{"_id":"school0000000000000001","name":"Shosuro Infiltrator School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Silent assassins who strike from shadows. Stealth and ambush specialists.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Reflexes</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Acting, Athletics, Ninjutsu, Sincerity, Stealth (Sneaking) 2, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 1.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Ashigaru or Light Armor, Sturdy Black Clothing, Daisho, Bow or Knife, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.102-132]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE PATH OF SHADOWS</h4>\n<p>No Honor loss for Low Skills/Ninjutsu Weapons in Scorpion service (GM approval). +2k0 Stealth rolls.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: STRIKE FROM DARKNESS</h4>\n<p>Attack unaware opponent: unlimited Raises, +School Rank rolled dice. Attack opponent with Condition: +half School Rank rolled dice. Not cumulative.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STEEL WITHIN SILK</h4>\n<p>Attack from ambush or with ninjutsu weapons: melee/ranged (shuriken/tsubute) as Simple Action.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: WHISPER OF STEEL</h4>\n<p>Single attack per round: opponents must win Investigation (Notice)/Perception vs Stealth/Agility to detect you. GM may rule ineffective if concealment impossible.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE FINAL SILENCE</h4>\n<p>After damage roll, spend Void: set two dice to 10s (don't explode). Multiple Void = multiple pairs.</p>\n\n<p>Ninja school. Low honor. Specializes in ambush attacks and stealth kills.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Scorpion/Ninja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
